returned data frame are relative to the package root.

\code{patterns} and \code{matches} each carry a \code{preview}: a display-only excerpt of the
line at \code{line_number}, whitespace collapsed, so the frames can be skimmed
without opening the files. A trailing \code{...} means there is more to see. A long
